      "claim": "The driver cannot repair the shortfall by accumulating separate in-geofence intervals under POL-NS-06(i). That limb requires a traffic_advisory that is present and populated, whose geometry covers the pickup road and whose active window covers the waiting period, carrying a type of KERB_RESTRICTION, ENFORCEMENT, CLOSURE or ACCIDENT. The only advisory in the bundle, EV-ADVIS-00901-01, is MISSING: weight 0.0 and no payload. Limb (i) is therefore unavailable and no interval may be summed. The absence is itself citable — there is no advisory on this record that could have made holding position at the pin lawfully impossible — and the 300-second minimum stands unadjusted.",
      "side": "RIDER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-ADVIS-00901-01 at weight_multiplier 0.0 but does not name its issue code(s): MISSING_ARTIFACT"
    },
    {
      "claim": "The facts that decide this dispute — the driver's arrival and his dwell — are carried by a single carrier. The trip_record's 08:43 marker was auto-confirmed from the same GPS measurement, so under POL-GEN-02 the marker and the trace are one artifact and not two, and no independent artifact corroborates either fact. POL-GEN-02 caps confidence at the weight of the artifact carrying the deciding fact, which here is 0.6, below the 0.70 floor. On this record the pipeline cannot sustain a charge against the rider, and to the extent the judge finds the deciding fact rests solely on impaired evidence, POL-NS-09(a) and (e) require the case to escalate with the disputed $5.00 held rather than collected — which at the very least means the rider does not fund a charge the record cannot support.",
      "side": "RIDER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-GPS-00901 at weight_multiplier 0.6 but does not name its issue code(s): LOW_SAMPLE_RATE, PARTIAL_RECORD"
    },
    {
      "claim": "POL-NS-06 refunds a rider only where the effective in-geofence dwell, computed under POL-NS-02, falls short of the minimum for the zone class. No such dwell is computable here, because no fix carries the accuracy POL-NS-02 requires, so the clause's premise cannot be established on this record. Its accumulation limb (i) is expressly unavailable as well: EV-ADVIS-00901-01, the traffic advisory, is MISSING, and limb (i) requires a traffic_advisory that is present and populated. A MISSING artifact keeps its identifier, carries weight 0.0, and can carry no fact; it cannot be asserted against, and it exonerates no one. The shortfall arithmetic therefore proves nothing against the fee. (The GPS trace is impaired: LOW_SAMPLE_RATE, PARTIAL_RECORD, weight 0.6.)",
      "side": "DRIVER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-ADVIS-00901-01 at weight_multiplier 0.0 but does not name its issue code(s): MISSING_ARTIFACT"
    }
